    "physicalNotes": [
      "Seat TL071CP with pin 1 at F13. Keep offset trim pins 1 and 5 and unused pin 8 isolated.",
      "Top TP is +12 V and top TM is -12 V. The bottom BM rail is 0 V. Use a current-limited isolated dual supply with the common terminal tied to 0 V.",
      "Connect a regulated 2.5 V reference to I22 and BM20.",
      "Connect output pin 6 directly to inverting input pin 2. Probe the output at B15 with respect to the 0 V rail.",
      "RLOAD connects the buffered output to the 0 V rail."
    ],
